   <text:h text:style-name="P5" text:outline-level="1"><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc89893447"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc89951952"/>Questions and answers in words<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc89893447"/><text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc89951952"/> </text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P32" loext:marker-style-name="T7"><text:span text:style-name="T7">The easiest questions to write have one question in words followed by a few answers in words. You need to provide one right answer and one or more wrong answers. The order of the answers will be mixed up in the app. You can have two answers, like &quot;True&quot; and &quot;False&quot;, or three or four answers, or even more depending on the question.</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7"/></text:p>
